[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14041.349, "timestamp": "03:54:01", "text": "还有那个东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14043.429, "timestamp": "03:54:03", "text": "有乏味的或中等的，而这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14047.03, "timestamp": "03:54:07", "text": "实际上一开始就像这样：啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14050.79, "timestamp": "03:54:10", "text": "对我来说，这不是我过去习惯的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14053.269, "timestamp": "03:54:13", "text": "大约在我刚开始……的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14063.429, "timestamp": "03:54:23", "text": "对这些感觉，呃，都是全新的体验，呃，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14066.71, "timestamp": "03:54:26", "text": "这些情绪，嫉妒又是什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14069.67, "timestamp": "03:54:29", "text": "这些创作者的事情对这位同辈人来说是正确的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14076.309, "timestamp": "03:54:36", "text": "他们开始从我身边消失。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14079.83, "timestamp": "03:54:39", "text": "我当时就想，哇！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14086.15, "timestamp": "03:54:46", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14095.67, "timestamp": "03:54:55", "text": "我想我算是吃一堑长一智了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14099.349, "timestamp": "03:54:59", "text": "准社会观众之类的。还不错"}]